    "peer_reviewed": "COLM 2025 conference paper",
    "problems": "The reported scaling experiment uses COSMOS models and video-generation metrics rather than pretraining loss. Table 1 reports no uncertainty estimates. The paper notes that automatic metrics such as FVD may not align well with human-perceived quality.",
    "rows_left_out": "Omitted Table 1 metrics IQ, MS, VQ, TC, DD, and FC; the COSMOS-12B single-pass comparison; Table 2 and Table 3 search-algorithm and text+image-to-video results; and the human-evaluation result in Figure 8. They concern inference-time video quality, not any listed claim version.",
